<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1697113448"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:36.000"><div begin="14.706" end="32.955" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.706" end="19.948" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.706" end="15.609">如果</span><span begin="15.609" end="15.938">离</span><span begin="15.938" end="16.534">别</span><span begin="16.534" end="16.928">是</span><span begin="16.928" end="17.432">为</span><span begin="17.432" end="18.045">了</span><span begin="18.045" end="18.714">能再</span><span begin="18.714" end="19.127">见</span><span begin="19.127" end="19.428">一</span><span begin="19.428" end="19.948">面</span></p><p begin="21.167" end="25.550" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.167" end="21.569">爱</span><span begin="21.569" end="21.853">是</span><span begin="21.853" end="22.331">想</span><span begin="22.331" end="22.909">念</span><span begin="22.909" end="23.401">后</span><span begin="23.401" end="23.652">的</span><span begin="23.652" end="24.135">抛</span><span begin="24.135" end="24.371">物</span><span begin="24.371" end="25.550">线</span></p><p begin="26.591" end="32.955" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.591" end="27.629">离开始</span><span begin="27.629" end="27.924">渐</span><span begin="27.924" end="28.831">行渐</span><span begin="28.831" end="29.285">远</span> <span begin="29.491" end="31.141">和我们总是</span><span begin="31.141" end="31.745">擦</span><span begin="31.745" end="32.955">肩</span></p></div><div begin="37.619" end="57.370" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="37.619" end="42.962" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.619" end="38.698">这次再</span><span begin="38.698" end="39.448">见</span><span begin="39.448" end="40.014">如果</span><span begin="40.014" end="40.787">是</span><span begin="40.787" end="41.600">最后</span><span begin="41.600" end="41.987">的</span><span begin="41.987" end="42.962">一面</span></p><p begin="43.993" end="48.403" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.993" end="45.145">也是失</span><span begin="45.145" end="45.743">眠</span><span begin="45.743" end="46.237">后</span><span begin="46.237" end="47.203">的分割</span><span begin="47.203" end="48.403">线</span></p><p begin="49.318" end="57.370" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.318" end="50.450">春天已</span><span begin="50.450" end="51.087">开始</span><span begin="51.087" end="51.644">落</span><span begin="51.644" end="52.207">叶</span> <span begin="52.298" end="54.014">七月里也会</span><span begin="54.014" end="54.412">下</span><span begin="54.412" end="57.370">雪</span></p></div><div begin="58.706" end="1:42.179" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="58.706" end="1:04.915" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.706" end="59.752">刚刚我</span><span begin="59.752" end="1:01.267">错过的大</span><span begin="1:01.267" end="1:01.945">雨</span> <span begin="1:02.260" end="1:02.964">握不</span><span begin="1:02.964" end="1:03.413">住</span><span begin="1:03.413" end="1:04.037">的盛</span><span begin="1:04.037" end="1:04.915">夏</span></p><p begin="1:05.151" end="1:10.509" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.151" end="1:06.002">飘过</span><span begin="1:06.002" end="1:06.540">的云</span><span begin="1:06.540" end="1:07.361">是你</span><span begin="1:07.361" end="1:07.801">吗</span> <span begin="1:07.801" end="1:07.963">一</span><span begin="1:07.963" end="1:08.912">圈又</span><span begin="1:08.912" end="1:09.485">一</span><span begin="1:09.485" end="1:10.509">圈</span></p><p begin="1:10.875" end="1:21.200" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.875" end="1:11.879">我多想</span><span begin="1:11.879" end="1:12.570">是路</span><span begin="1:12.570" end="1:13.350">过</span><span begin="1:13.350" end="1:13.852">你的</span><span begin="1:13.852" end="1:14.543">风</span> <span begin="1:14.856" end="1:15.201">忍</span><span begin="1:15.201" end="1:15.413">不</span><span begin="1:15.413" end="1:16.171">住</span><span begin="1:16.171" end="1:16.930">落回</span><span begin="1:16.930" end="1:17.376">你</span><span begin="1:17.376" end="1:17.777">眼</span